.th TIME II 8/5/73
.sh NAME
time \*- get date and time
.sh SYNOPSIS
(time = 13.)
.br
.ft B
sys  time
.s3
long time();
.br
.ft R
.sh DESCRIPTION
.it Time
returns the time since 00:00:00 GMT, Jan. 1, 1970, measured
in seconds.
From
.it as,
the high order word is in the r0 register and the low order
is in r1.
From C, the value is returned as a 
.it long.
.sh "SEE ALSO"
date (I), stime (II), ctime (III), ijtime(III)
.sh DIAGNOSTICS
\*-
